{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type PhysicalKey = `[${PhysicalKeyCode}]`;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L224","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key.types.ts:224"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An explicit physical key token. All codes use brackets, including names such\nas "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[Enter]"},{"type":"text","value":" that also exist as logical keys. Invalid code names are rejected\nby TypeScript, and supported names are available in autocomplete."}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype PhysicalKey = `[${PhysicalKeyCode}]`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key.types.ts:224](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L224)\n\nAn explicit physical key token. All codes use brackets, including names such\nas `[Enter]` that also exist as logical keys. Invalid code names are rejected\nby TypeScript, and supported names are available in autocomplete.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: PhysicalKey\ntitle: PhysicalKey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype PhysicalKey = `[${PhysicalKeyCode}]`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [key.types.ts:224](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/key.types.ts#L224)\n\nAn explicit physical key token. All codes use brackets, including names such\nas `[Enter]` that also exist as logical keys. Invalid code names are rejected\nby TypeScript, and supported names are available in autocomplete.\n"}
